# Default-deny Docker build context.  Images need only application sources,
# locked dependencies, migrations and Docker runtime assets.
*
!src/
!src/**
!requirements/
!requirements/**
!migrations/
!migrations/**
!docker/
!docker/**
!pyproject.toml
!README.md

# Keep the policy itself visible to the builder for reproducibility.
!.dockerignore

# macOS AppleDouble sidecars are metadata, never source files or migrations.
._*
